# docs/status.md is append-mostly (log) and steward-owned (snapshot): when two branches add lines at
# the same spot, keep both instead of conflicting (decision 0021). Applies to local merges, e.g. an
# agent's `git merge origin/main`. Its in-place sections (snapshot, critical lane) are steward-owned
# and rewritten daily, so a stale duplicate line lasts at most a day. Deliberately not used for
# docs/excel-semantics/, where entries are edited in place and a silent union could keep two
# contradictory versions of a rule.
docs/status.md merge=union
